  "description": "In a world where a person’s lifespan is determined by a clock placed in his or her chest at birth, people with the ability to manipulate these clocks to grant immortality began to emerge. Known as clockworkers, they are separated by those motivated by greed and those who want the world to be balanced. Each side wants to destroy the other and two brothers find themselves on opposite sides of the fight after a tragic accident in the past.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comico.kr/titles/103)",
